.\" Agent Toolkit Desktop man page (#1116/#1057, #1130 vertical)
.TH AGENT-TOOLKIT-DESKTOP 1 "2026-09-07" "Agent Toolkit 1.30.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agent-toolkit-desktop \- Agent Toolkit Desktop — the Paper Co. coding-agent workstation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agent-toolkit-desktop
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Agent Toolkit Desktop
is the native desktop application for managing skills, agents, MCP providers,
targets, loops, swarms and telemetry from a warm pixel-art office. It boots to
onboarding on first run and renders catalog truth even when no coding-agent
CLI is installed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print the help overview and exit.
.SH KEYBOARD
.TP
.B /
Open the command palette (typed registry search).
.TP
.B 1\-0, p, i, o
Switch primary panels (Office, Skills, Agents, MCP, Targets, Doctor, Jobs,
Loops, Swarm, Workspace, Products, Insights, Onboarding).
.TP
.B T
Cycle appearance (Paper → Ink → System; persists).
.TP
.B Ctrl+= / Ctrl+\- / Ctrl+0
Zoom in / out / reset.
.TP
.B H
Help overlay. .B Esc closes the innermost context.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ATK_GUI_HEADLESS=1
Run headless (no window) — CI smoke and clean-machine validation.
.TP
.B ATK_GUI_FREEZE=1
Freeze visual nondeterminism for captures.
.TP
.B AGENT_TOOLKIT_ROOT
Toolkit data-root override (Project > Workspace > Toolkit precedence).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/agent-toolkit/desktop/
Extracted fonts, engine state, UI state (created at runtime).
.TP
.I ~/.config/agent-toolkit/
Configuration and install receipts.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/agent-toolkit/bin/
Installed binary (default per-user install location).
.SH SEE ALSO
.B agent-toolkit(1)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/ulises-jeremias/agent-toolkit/issues
